{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585630/extras/351e8d9cd600781caf9e17d60bb3758a.avif?t=1760127121\" width=800 height=188 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 What does a SUPERVILLAIN do, when he is forbidden from doing anything evil for the day? \ud83d\udc51</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is it!!! <strong>ROYAL the SUPERVILLAIN</strong> has finally completed his SUPER KINGLY WEAPON. Thanks to it, he can finally end the reign of the heroes of CITYVILLE, the GIRLS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, what's this? There's a maintenance? Because of it, <strong>he can't enact any evil deeds today</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it's all fine! <strong>There's lots to do today.</strong> So watch ROYAL yap on and on about his job, about his past, about what it means to be \u2612\u2612\u2612\u2612\u2612, <strong>and smile at his funny antics</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585630/extras/b249948623ad80b3cf5919d179a4a71e.avif?t=1760127121\" width=800 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ROYAL</strong>, the most \u2612\u2612\u2612\u2612\u2612 SUPERVILLAIN of CITYVILLE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hover over pink words to learn more about ROYAL!</strong> What's his SUPER KINGLY WEAPON? How many PARTIES has he been to? How many games has he starred in?!?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is so short</strong>, you can finish it in less than 30 minutes! You will have the rest of the day free for all your subquests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A counter on the bottom right of the screen...?</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This is not the type of game where you can make meaningful choices.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585630?t=1760127121","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585630/11888873f69b51426a8bc1fb0fc75a58b13903db/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760127121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585630/a601809be369cf7be1666fcf06c54bf6a25f52d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760127121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585630/a601809be369cf7be1666fcf06c54bf6a25f52d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760127121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585630/extras/351e8d9cd600781caf9e17d60bb3758a.avif?t=1760127121\" width=800 height=188 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc51 What does a SUPERVILLAIN do, when he is forbidden from doing anything evil for the day? \ud83d\udc51</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is it!!! <strong>ROYAL the SUPERVILLAIN</strong> has finally completed his SUPER KINGLY WEAPON. Thanks to it, he can finally end the reign of the heroes of CITYVILLE, the GIRLS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But, what's this? There's a maintenance? Because of it, <strong>he can't enact any evil deeds today</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, it's all fine! <strong>There's lots to do today.</strong> So watch ROYAL yap on and on about his job, about his pas